{"steam_appid":4521680,"steam_name":"Painting PC","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4521680/1827046839/0ee5b85f252d823135d1a6c64944a2904d276d38/1782710954/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1782711219","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257350170/3df367f6d94e7c9d98e757641a9679744431b1d5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1782711219","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/3c8a2c199e5a6e6899d323ead8104442e4c1b651/ss_3c8a2c199e5a6e6899d323ead8104442e4c1b651.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783066138","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/83d6e7b58c00928f4689fd2870bd010e2c421e04/ss_83d6e7b58c00928f4689fd2870bd010e2c421e04.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783066138","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/dbd7b97ce87633ad1764dcda3df26b2efa6721a1/ss_dbd7b97ce87633ad1764dcda3df26b2efa6721a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783066138","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/0ac4e2747e6b90618b2d11b91ab097db7a06d747/ss_0ac4e2747e6b90618b2d11b91ab097db7a06d747.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783066138","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/f103c3fb7ebdab78ec3e5aef48eaad514e58283b/ss_f103c3fb7ebdab78ec3e5aef48eaad514e58283b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783066138"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/47934fe02a3fe541cffaf5887f53bd18.avif?t=1783066138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras_big/47934fe02a3fe541cffaf5887f53bd18.webp?t=1783066138 width=1560 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a studio with one brush and absolutely no followers. Complete commissions, gain followers, unlock new tools, and work your way to becoming the next big thing on the Paintigraph app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/895d2eb2c8853d34bdb74ec82b5ddda7.poster.avif?t=1783066138\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/895d2eb2c8853d34bdb74ec82b5ddda7.webm?t=1783066138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/895d2eb2c8853d34bdb74ec82b5ddda7.mp4?t=1783066138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/0a23a6d6f1c6fa5fcc31388280e17696.avif?t=1783066138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras_big/0a23a6d6f1c6fa5fcc31388280e17696.webp?t=1783066138 width=1560 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out that art is subjective. One client thinks you’re Michelangelo, the next is completely confused. Just make it work, get ratings, and get paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/325b02718579110ec12e98b242c92ce9.poster.avif?t=1783066138\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/325b02718579110ec12e98b242c92ce9.webm?t=1783066138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/325b02718579110ec12e98b242c92ce9.mp4?t=1783066138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/5611fac5ab01aeffc22de26b68fa0ea0.avif?t=1783066138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras_big/5611fac5ab01aeffc22de26b68fa0ea0.webp?t=1783066138 width=1560 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your followers grow, you'll unlock and expand the premium toolkit to paint even cooler masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/0673a45a73ab679a84784064dcd3f4d5.poster.avif?t=1783066138\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/0673a45a73ab679a84784064dcd3f4d5.webm?t=1783066138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/0673a45a73ab679a84784064dcd3f4d5.mp4?t=1783066138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/21b343c9984be2fff50416fe66e37ade.avif?t=1783066138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras_big/21b343c9984be2fff50416fe66e37ade.webp?t=1783066138 width=1560 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take that sweet commission cash and spend it on cool furniture and decorations. Turn that minimalistic cabin into a studio that’s completely your vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521680/extras/0f946fb63ff560e87068a0b351bcd2ab.poster.avif?t=1783066138\" width=900 hei